<title>USA: BankBoston opens first branch in Peru.</title>
<headline>BankBoston opens first branch in Peru.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankBoston Corp said Thursday it officially opened its first office in Lima, Peru which will focus on corporate and investment banking, global custody, trade finance and securities trading services.</p>
<p>BankBoston said it has the third-largest overseas network of any U.S. bank with more than 100 offices in 23 countries.</p>
<p>-- Boston bureau (617) 367-4106</p>
